# Win2Lin Recovery Bundle Checklist (template)

> Privacy: This bundle must **never** include passwords, cookies/session tokens, DPAPI/keychain credentials, private keys, or MFA secrets. Use your password manager/browser/account recovery for those.

## Bundle info
- Created: {{created_at}}
- Host: {{host}} (non-sensitive)
- Profile: {{profile}}
- Encryption: {{encryption}} (if used, key/passphrase loss = unrecoverable)

## Integrity
- [ ] Manifest present
- [ ] Checksums verified (SHA-256 where available)
- [ ] Restore drill completed (sample files)

## Essential data
- [ ] Critical documents/projects included
- [ ] Exclusions reviewed

## Rebuild plan
- [ ] App inventory/reinstall list
- [ ] Dev environment intent (reproducible, no binaries assumed)
- [ ] Identity re-bootstrap checklist (re-auth only)

## Restore order
1. Verify integrity
2. Restore critical data
3. Install OS/apps/drivers (manual/approved)
4. Restore safe configs (no-clobber)
5. Re-authenticate accounts
6. Validate accessibility and core workflows
